hilde (1.1.4) stable; urgency=low

  * Added a heartbeat that the runtime writes while a Sperli rank computes.
  * Added hilde run --resume and --checkpoint-every, and Standard.Sperli.checkpointDue.
  * Added sperli_checkpoint_due to libsperli.
  * Added restart, PreVote, learners and leadership transfer to Standard.Raft.
  * Added a lent connection to the SQLite driver.
  * Added Standard.Arguments.programPath.
  * Sperli runs on OpenBSD and FreeBSD; its certificates are ECDSA P-256.
  * Libraries built with hilde compile are optimised like programmes.
  * Strings are copied in one piece; Sperli through libsperli is much faster.
  * Small bugfixes and improvements.

 -- Heiko Zimmermann <code@heiko-zimmermann.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

hilde (1.1.3) stable; urgency=low

  * Added operator precedence: operators bind in the usual order.
  * Added Standard.File.standardStream for the standard streams.
  * Added palette images to Standard.Png.
  * Added the style attribute to Standard.Html.
  * Added Standard.Sort.sortWith, a stable sort with a context.
  * Added hilde run --rank-program and the option --standard.
  * Added contract hints with hilde check --missing-contracts.
  * Literals through a reference take the type they are assigned to.
  * A write reference is accepted where a read reference is asked.
  * hilde check reports the errors of every module, not only the first.
  * hilde test, compile and guard fall back on the standard library.
  * hilde test --contracts tries the literals of a requires as boundaries.
  * Programmes built in parts are linked with -flto.
  * Small bugfixes and improvements.

 -- Heiko Zimmermann <code@heiko-zimmermann.com>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0100

